        "content": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"zh-CN\">\n<head>\n    <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n    <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n    <title>意林创刊</title>\n    <style>\n        body {\n            margin: 0;\n            padding: 20px;\n            display: flex;\n            justify-content: center;\n            background-color: #f5f5f5;\n            font-family: \"PingFang SC\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", \"SimSun\", sans-serif;\n        }\n\n        .document-container {\n            width: 750px;\n            background-color: #ffffff;\n            border: 1.5px solid #23378d;\n            padding: 30px 40px;\n            box-sizing: border-box;\n            position: relative;\n        }\n\n        /* Header Section */\n        .header {\n            display: flex;\n            justify-content: space-between;\n            align-items: flex-start;\n            margin-bottom: 45px;\n        }\n\n        .title-container {\n            position: relative;\n            padding-left: 4px;\n            padding-top: 4px;\n        }\n\n        .title-border {\n            position: absolute;\n            top: 0;\n            left: 0;\n            width: 25px;\n            height: 25px;\n            border-left: 3px solid #1c3b9b;\n            border-top: 3px solid #1c3b9b;\n        }\n\n        .title-text {\n            border: 1px solid #1c3b9b;\n            color: #d11f27;\n            font-size: 15px;\n            font-weight: bold;\n            padding: 3px 8px;\n            position: relative;\n            background: white;\n            letter-spacing: 1px;\n            transform: translate(3px, 3px);\n            display: inline-block;\n        }\n\n        .arrows {\n            display: flex;\n            gap: 12px;\n            margin-top: 10px;\n            margin-right: 5px;\n        }\n\n        .arrow {\n            width: 0;\n            height: 0;\n            border-top: 6px solid transparent;\n            border-bottom: 6px solid transparent;\n            border-left: 10px solid;\n        }\n\n        .a1 { border-left-color: #173b9e; }\n        .a2 { border-left-color: #3164bd; }\n        .a3 { border-left-color: #5c97d5; }\n        .a4 { border-left-color: #8bc2eb; }\n        .a5 { border-left-color: #c9e8ea; }\n\n        /* Highlight/Quote Blocks */\n        .quote-block {\n            position: relative;\n            margin: 25px 0 35px 0;\n        }\n\n        .quote-line {\n            height: 1px;\n            background-color: #f7e6cd;\n            width: 100%;\n        }\n\n        .quote-content {\n            display: flex;\n            align-items: center;\n            padding: 16px 0;\n        }\n\n        .icon-heart {\n            margin-right: 15px;\n            margin-left: 10px;\n            display: flex;\n            align-items: center;\n            justify-content: center;\n        }\n\n        .quote-text {\n            color: #c0462e;\n            font-size: 15px;\n            letter-spacing: 0.5px;\n        }\n\n        .icon-leaf {\n            position: absolute;\n            right: -5px;\n            bottom: -15px;\n        }\n\n        /* Paragraphs */\n        .body-text {\n            font-size: 14.5px;\n            color: #333333;\n            line-height: 2.2;\n            margin: 0 0 18px 0;\n            padding: 0 10px;\n            text-align: justify;\n        }\n        \n        .section-gap {\n            margin-top: 45px;\n        }\n    </style>\n</head>\n<body>\n\n    <div class=\"document-container\">\n        \n        <!-- Header -->\n        <div class=\"header\">\n            <div class=\"title-container\">\n                <div class=\"title-border\"></div>\n                <div class=\"title-text\">意林创刊</div>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"arrows\">\n                <div class=\"arrow a1\"></div>\n                <div class=\"arrow a2\"></div>\n                <div class=\"arrow a3\"></div>\n                <div class=\"arrow a4\"></div>\n                <div class=\"arrow a5\"></div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n\n        <!-- First Quote Block -->\n        <div class=\"quote-block\">\n            <div class=\"quote-line\"></div>\n            <div class=\"quote-content\">\n                <div class=\"icon-heart\">\n                    <!-- Stylized golden heart SVG approximation -->\n                    <svg width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\">\n                        <path fill=\"#f2c57c\" d=\"M12 21.35l-1.45-1.32C5.4 15.36 2 12.28 2 8.5 2 5.42 4.42 3 7.5 3c1.74 0 3.41.81 4.5 2.09C13.09 3.81 14.76 3 16.5 3 19.58 3 22 5.42 22 8.5c0 3.78-3.4 6.86-8.55 11.54L12 21.35z\"/>\n                    </svg>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"quote-text\">2023年7月，《意林》将迎来她的20岁。</div>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"quote-line\"></div>\n            <div class=\"icon-leaf\">\n                <!-- Stylized leaf branch SVG approximation -->\n                <svg width=\"35\" height=\"25\" viewBox=\"0 0 35 25\">\n                    <path d=\"M5,20 Q18,12 30,5\" stroke=\"#6f8a75\" fill=\"none\" stroke-width=\"1.2\"/>\n                    <circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"15\" r=\"2\" fill=\"#6f8a75\"/>\n                    <circle cx=\"22\" cy=\"10\" r=\"2.5\" fill=\"#6f8a75\"/>\n                    <circle cx=\"28\" cy=\"7\" r=\"1.5\" fill=\"#6f8a75\"/>\n                    <circle cx=\"16\" cy=\"18\" r=\"1.5\" fill=\"#8fa594\"/>\n                    <circle cx=\"25\" cy=\"13\" r=\"1.2\" fill=\"#8fa594\"/>\n                    <path d=\"M8,18 Q12,12 15,10\" stroke=\"#f2c57c\" fill=\"none\" stroke-width=\"1\"/>\n                </svg>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n\n        <!-- First Text Section -->\n        <p class=\"body-text\">《意林》的20年，是风华正茂仍守正创新，是惊涛骇浪却勇立潮头的20年。</p>\n        <p class=\"body-text\">《意林》的20年，是一匹黑马走出吉林，面向中国，奔往世界的20年。</p>\n        <p class=\"body-text\">《意林》的20年，是中国期刊史上不会被遗忘的一朵空谷幽兰，是中国人20年来精神文化坐标轴上无法被抹除的一片养眼绿意。</p>\n        <p class=\"body-text\">20岁的人生可以不惜一切追寻梦想，挑战命运，无惧失败。</p>\n        <p class=\"body-text\">20岁的《意林》，同样敢于乘风破浪，勇为人先。</p>\n\n        <!-- Second Quote Block -->\n        <div class=\"quote-block section-gap\">\n            <div class=\"quote-line\"></div>\n            <div class=\"quote-content\">\n                <div class=\"icon-heart\">\n                    <svg width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\">\n                        <path fill=\"#f2c57c\" d=\"M12 21.35l-1.45-1.32C5.4 15.36 2 12.28 2 8.5 2 5.42 4.42 3 7.5 3c1.74 0 3.41.81 4.5 2.09C13.09 3.81 14.76 3 16.5 3 19.58 3 22 5.42 22 8.5c0 3.78-3.4 6.86-8.55 11.54L12 21.35z\"/>\n                    </svg>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"quote-text\">问人生能有几个十年，历尽繁华不如正当青春。</div>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"quote-line\"></div>\n            <div class=\"icon-leaf\">\n                <svg width=\"35\" height=\"25\" viewBox=\"0 0 35 25\">\n                    <path d=\"M5,20 Q18,12 30,5\" stroke=\"#6f8a75\" fill=\"none\" stroke-width=\"1.2\"/>\n                    <circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"15\" r=\"2\" fill=\"#6f8a75\"/>\n                    <circle cx=\"22\" cy=\"10\" r=\"2.5\" fill=\"#6f8a75\"/>\n                    <circle cx=\"28\" cy=\"7\" r=\"1.5\" fill=\"#6f8a75\"/>\n                    <circle cx=\"16\" cy=\"18\" r=\"1.5\" fill=\"#8fa594\"/>\n                    <circle cx=\"25\" cy=\"13\" r=\"1.2\" fill=\"#8fa594\"/>\n                    <path d=\"M8,18 Q12,12 15,10\" stroke=\"#f2c57c\" fill=\"none\" stroke-width=\"1\"/>\n                </svg>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n\n        <!-- Second Text Section -->\n        <p class=\"body-text section-gap\">20岁，意气风发，青春正好；20岁，却也初尝世事沧桑。</p>\n        <p class=\"body-text\">20岁，有想征服世界的野心，也有付诸课堂内外的努力。</p>\n        <p class=\"body-text\">为庆祝《意林》杂志创刊20周年，感恩您与《意林》风雨同舟的20年，《意林》将用10万元征集100篇“我的20岁”故事集结出版。</p>\n        <p class=\"body-text\">我们诚邀《意林》的同龄人——20周岁的你，讲述你的20岁故事，你的成长，你人生最初的“向前一步”。</p>\n        <p class=\"body-text\">我们也欢迎那些在《意林》的陪伴下已经度过20岁的朋友，回望青春年华，为自己写就“重返20岁”不一样的人生故事。</p>\n\n    </div>\n\n</body>\n</html>"
